# Appended to the common seabios.config. The operator runs MS-DOS, FreeDOS and Linux only on this board (2026-10-22):
# what only Windows or the setup's board test use is off, to fit 128 KiB with the Trident VGA ROM.
# CONFIG_NEWBIOS_TOOL_BOARD_TEST is not set
# PnP BIOS and its ESCD (Windows 9x); the POST's ISA PnP card setup stays
# CONFIG_PNPBIOS is not set
# No BIOS mouse services in DOS (also no USB mouse emulation)
# CONFIG_MOUSE is not set
# The Trident VGA BIOS is the CBFS file pci1023,9660.rom (LZMA, PORT_PLAN D2): SeaBIOS reads CBFS
CONFIG_COREBOOT_FLASH=y
CONFIG_LZMA=y
